      "texto": {
        "es": "¿Cabe tu evento? Hasta seiscientas personas de pie: así se ven, a escala, dentro del jardín. O unas trescientas sentadas: aquí van treinta mesas de diez, dibujadas a la misma escala, y sobra pasillo entre mesa y mesa. Por encima de eso no entra, y preferimos decírtelo antes de la visita.",
        "en": "Does your event fit? Up to six hundred people standing: this is what they look like, to scale, inside the garden. Or about three hundred seated: here are thirty tables of ten, drawn at the same scale, with room to walk between them. Above that it does not fit, and we would rather tell you before the visit."
